function hubDateOnlyUtc(day){return /^\d{4}-\d{2}-\d{2}$/.test(String(day))?String(day)+'T00:00:00Z':'';}function hubDayFromDateOnly(v){var s=String(v||'');return /^\d{4}-\d{2}-\d{2}/.test(s)?s.slice(0,10):'';}function hubAddDays(day,n){var t=Date.UTC(Number(day.slice(0,4)),Number(day.slice(5,7))-1,Number(day.slice(8,10)))+n*86400000,d=new Date(t);return d.getUTCFullYear()+'-'+hubPad2(d.getUTCMonth()+1)+'-'+hubPad2(d.getUTCDate());}// The week key: the Monday of the plant week a day is in (weeks run Monday to Sunday, as in the Clean Plan 'k|Monday' rows).
